flowchart TD
  A[User: Telegram / trusted local client / paired device] --> B[Authenticate sender and scope; save stable request ID]
  B -->|Unknown sender or device| X[Refuse access]
  B -->|Owner /report| R[Read saved board; no model call]
  B -->|Work or question| C[Chief model reads priorities, relevant card and owner registry]
  C -->|Direct answer| U[Update relevant evidence and task state]
  C -->|Project work| D[Brief the existing project owner once]
  D --> E[Owner plans, implements, checks and releases within authority]
  E --> F[Return completed outcome or exact missing input]
  F --> U
  U --> G[Reply to original enrolled recipient through durable outbox]
  G --> H[Confirm delivery; never blindly replay uncertain sends]
  C <--> K[Markdown board: Backlog / Todo / Doing / Review / Done]
  U --> K
  S[Authorized recurring card becomes due] --> B
  U -->|Recurring work completed| T[Record completion; return same card to Todo with next date]
  T --> K
  E --> W[Scoped tools / paired resources / specialists if useful]
